 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "wp01-01",
   "section": "wp01",
   "zh": "老师懂得多，站在讲台上。",
   "en": "A teacher knows a lot and stands at the front of the classroom.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp01-01"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp01-01"
   ],
   "start": 4.0,
   "end": 8.99,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 4.2,
     "end": 7.6
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 4.2,
     "end": 8.44
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp01-02",
   "section": "wp01",
   "zh": "那老师说的每句话，都一定对吗？",
   "en": "Does that mean every word the teacher says is right?",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp01-02"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp01-02"
   ],
   "start": 8.99,
   "end": 13.34,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 9.19,
     "end": 12.39
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 9.19,
     "end": 12.79
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp01-03",
   "section": "wp01",
   "zh": "孩子年纪小，说的话也值得听吗？",
   "en": "Can a young child say something worth hearing too?",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp01-03"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp01-03"
   ],
   "start": 13.34,
   "end": 18.49,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 13.54,
     "end": 17.94
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 13.54,
     "end": 17.9
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp01-04",
   "section": "wp01",
   "zh": "谈全人教育，我们先从这里开始：教育的权柄，到底从哪里来？",
   "en": "This is where we begin with whole-person education: where does the authority to teach come from?",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp01-04"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp01-04"
   ],
   "start": 18.49,
   "end": 27.8,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 18.69,
     "end": 24.85
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 18.69,
     "end": 26.25
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp02-01",
   "section": "wp02",
   "zh": "主祷文里有一句话：“因为国度、权柄、荣耀，全是你的，直到永远。阿们。”",
   "en": "The traditional ending of the Lord's Prayer says, “For yours is the kingdom and the power and the glory forever. Amen.”",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp02-01"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp02-01"
   ],
   "start": 27.8,
   "end": 37.51,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 28.0,
     "end": 35.76
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 28.0,
     "end": 35.76
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp02-02",
   "section": "wp02",
   "zh": "这句话提醒我们：一切属于神，教育也在其中。",
   "en": "It reminds us that everything belongs to God, including education.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp02-02"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp02-02"
   ],
   "start": 37.51,
   "end": 43.74,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 37.71,
     "end": 42.47
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 37.71,
     "end": 43.19
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp02-03",
   "section": "wp02",
   "zh": "我们教的人，生命也属于神。",
   "en": "The person we teach belongs to God too.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp02-03"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp02-03"
   ],
   "start": 43.74,
   "end": 47.93,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 43.94,
     "end": 47.38
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 43.94,
     "end": 47.02
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp02-04",
   "section": "wp02",
   "zh": "我们说“主权”，先说的就是这一点。",
   "en": "This is where our question of sovereignty begins.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp02-04"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp02-04"
   ],
   "start": 47.93,
   "end": 53.68,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 48.13,
     "end": 50.73
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 48.13,
     "end": 52.13
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp03-01",
   "section": "wp03",
   "zh": "耶稣说，天上地下所有的权柄都赐给他了。",
   "en": "Jesus said that all authority in heaven and on earth had been given to him.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp03-01"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp03-01"
   ],
   "start": 53.68,
   "end": 59.51,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 53.88,
     "end": 58.52
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 53.88,
     "end": 58.96
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp03-02",
   "section": "wp03",
   "zh": "接着，他吩咐门徒去教导人。",
   "en": "Then he sent his disciples to teach.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp03-02"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp03-02"
   ],
   "start": 59.51,
   "end": 63.98,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 59.71,
     "end": 63.43
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 59.71,
     "end": 62.31
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp03-03",
   "section": "wp03",
   "zh": "我们从这里明白：教导的权柄是领受的。",
   "en": "We understand the authority to teach as something received.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp03-03"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp03-03"
   ],
   "start": 63.98,
   "end": 69.89,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 64.18,
     "end": 69.34
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 64.18,
     "end": 68.1
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp03-04",
   "section": "wp03",
   "zh": "老师要先学习、明白神的话，再认真解释。",
   "en": "A teacher first learns and seeks to understand God's word, then explains it carefully.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp03-04"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp03-04"
   ],
   "start": 69.89,
   "end": 76.68,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 70.09,
     "end": 74.29
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 70.09,
     "end": 76.13
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp03-05",
   "section": "wp03",
   "zh": "讲的时候，也要让人知道：这句话的根据在哪里？",
   "en": "The people listening should also be able to ask: what is this teaching based on?",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp03-05"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp03-05"
   ],
   "start": 76.68,
   "end": 84.07,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 76.88,
     "end": 82.0
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 76.88,
     "end": 82.52
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp04-01",
   "section": "wp04",
   "zh": "圣经记着一群人。他们认真听讲道，也天天查考圣经，看看听到的话是不是这样。",
   "en": "The Bible tells us about people who listened carefully to teaching and examined the Scriptures every day to see whether it was true.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp04-01",
    "wp04-02"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp04-01"
   ],
   "start": 84.07,
   "end": 93.72,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 84.27,
     "end": 93.17
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 84.27,
     "end": 92.03
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp04-03",
   "section": "wp04",
   "zh": "我们也可以这样学。",
   "en": "We can learn that way too.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp04-03"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp04-02"
   ],
   "start": 93.72,
   "end": 96.59,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 93.92,
     "end": 95.64
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 93.92,
     "end": 96.04
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp04-04",
   "section": "wp04",
   "zh": "孩子可以问：“这句话是什么意思？”",
   "en": "A child can ask, “What does this mean?”",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp04-04"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp04-03"
   ],
   "start": 96.59,
   "end": 101.18,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 96.79,
     "end": 100.63
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 96.79,
     "end": 100.11
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp04-05",
   "section": "wp04",
   "zh": "老师可以说：“我们一起看看前后在讲什么。”",
   "en": "A teacher can say, “Let's read the words around it together.”",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp04-05"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp04-04"
   ],
   "start": 101.18,
   "end": 106.49,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 101.38,
     "end": 105.78
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 101.38,
     "end": 105.94
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp04-06",
   "section": "wp04",
   "zh": "如果理解错了，就一起改过来。",
   "en": "If we have understood it wrongly, we can correct it together.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp04-06"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp04-05"
   ],
   "start": 106.49,
   "end": 112.8,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 106.69,
     "end": 109.57
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 106.69,
     "end": 111.25
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp05-01",
   "section": "wp05",
   "zh": "孩子也可以明白神的话。",
   "en": "Children can understand God's word too.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp05-01"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp05-01"
   ],
   "start": 112.8,
   "end": 116.43,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 113.0,
     "end": 115.88
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 113.0,
     "end": 115.72
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp05-02",
   "section": "wp05",
   "zh": "耶稣说，天父把这些事向小孩子显明。",
   "en": "Jesus thanked his Father for revealing these things to little children.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp05-02"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp05-02"
   ],
   "start": 116.43,
   "end": 122.22,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 116.63,
     "end": 121.47
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 116.63,
     "end": 121.67
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp05-03",
   "section": "wp05",
   "zh": "大人和孩子说出的真话，都值得我们听。",
   "en": "True words deserve our attention, whether they come from an adult or a child.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp05-03"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp05-03"
   ],
   "start": 122.22,
   "end": 128.17,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 122.42,
     "end": 126.34
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 122.42,
     "end": 127.62
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp05-04",
   "section": "wp05",
   "zh": "孩子也会看见老师没注意到的事。",
   "en": "A child may also notice something a teacher has missed.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp05-04"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp05-04"
   ],
   "start": 128.17,
   "end": 132.96,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 128.37,
     "end": 131.05
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 128.37,
     "end": 132.41
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp05-05",
   "section": "wp05",
   "zh": "比如：“老师，他刚才举手了，还没有说完。”",
   "en": "“Teacher, he raised his hand, but he hasn't finished speaking.”",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp05-05"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp05-05"
   ],
   "start": 132.96,
   "end": 138.91,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 133.16,
     "end": 137.92
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 133.16,
     "end": 138.36
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp05-06",
   "section": "wp05",
   "zh": "这一句话，可能让老师发现自己漏听了一个人。",
   "en": "Those words may help the teacher notice someone they overlooked.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp05-06"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp05-06"
   ],
   "start": 138.91,
   "end": 143.86,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 139.11,
     "end": 143.23
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 139.11,
     "end": 143.31
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp05-07",
   "section": "wp05",
   "zh": "那一刻，孩子在帮助老师。",
   "en": "In that moment, the child is helping the teacher.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp05-07"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp05-07"
   ],
   "start": 143.86,
   "end": 150.13,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 144.06,
     "end": 147.34
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 144.06,
     "end": 148.58
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp06-01",
   "section": "wp06",
   "zh": "认真听孩子，老师也要把该做的事做好。",
   "en": "Listening to children goes together with doing a teacher's job well.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp06-01"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp06-01"
   ],
   "start": 150.13,
   "end": 156.12,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 150.33,
     "end": 154.37
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 150.33,
     "end": 155.57
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp06-02",
   "section": "wp06",
   "zh": "有人遇到困难，要帮助；有人伤害别人，要制止；一道题算错了，要说明错在哪里。",
   "en": "Help someone who is struggling. Stop someone from hurting another person. Explain why an answer to a maths problem is wrong.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp06-02"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp06-02",
    "wp06-03",
    "wp06-04"
   ],
   "start": 156.12,
   "end": 167.23,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 156.32,
     "end": 165.88
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 156.32,
     "end": 165.68
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp06-03",
   "section": "wp06",
   "zh": "老师可以提出要求，也要让孩子明白为什么。",
   "en": "A teacher can set expectations and explain the reasons.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp06-03"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp06-05"
   ],
   "start": 167.23,
   "end": 172.42,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 167.43,
     "end": 171.87
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 167.43,
     "end": 171.71
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp06-04",
   "section": "wp06",
   "zh": "说到神的话，就一起看圣经；说到算题，就把算式讲清楚。",
   "en": "When discussing God's word, read Scripture together. When discussing a maths problem, show the calculation clearly.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp06-04"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp06-06",
    "wp06-07"
   ],
   "start": 172.42,
   "end": 185.15,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 172.62,
     "end": 178.22
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 172.62,
     "end": 182.8
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp07-01",
   "section": "wp07",
   "zh": "耶稣也提醒过人：有人拿走知识的钥匙，挡住想进去的人。",
   "en": "Jesus warned about people taking away the key to knowledge and blocking those who wanted to enter.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp07-01"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp07-01"
   ],
   "start": 185.15,
   "end": 193.06,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 185.35,
     "end": 190.51
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 185.35,
     "end": 192.51
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp07-02",
   "section": "wp07",
   "zh": "老师选择故事、安排提问、分配说话的时间，会影响大家能学到什么。",
   "en": "Teachers choose stories, invite questions, and decide how speaking time is shared. These choices affect what people can learn.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp07-02"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp07-02",
    "wp07-03"
   ],
   "start": 193.06,
   "end": 204.87,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 193.26,
     "end": 200.1
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 193.26,
     "end": 204.32
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp07-03",
   "section": "wp07",
   "zh": "所以，我们可以问：谁还没有被听见？",
   "en": "So we can ask: who has not been heard?",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp07-03"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp07-04"
   ],
   "start": 204.87,
   "end": 210.46,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 205.07,
     "end": 209.91
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 205.07,
     "end": 208.79
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp07-04",
   "section": "wp07",
   "zh": "谁需要多一点帮助？",
   "en": "Who needs more help?",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp07-04"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp07-05"
   ],
   "start": 210.46,
   "end": 213.85,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 210.66,
     "end": 212.7
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 210.66,
     "end": 213.3
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp07-05",
   "section": "wp07",
   "zh": "还有什么问题，值得一起看看？",
   "en": "What other question should we explore together?",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp07-05"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp07-06"
   ],
   "start": 213.85,
   "end": 219.6,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 214.05,
     "end": 216.37
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 214.05,
     "end": 217.25
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp08-01",
   "section": "wp08",
   "zh": "耶稣是老师，也是主。",
   "en": "Jesus was their teacher and Lord.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp08-01"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp08-01"
   ],
   "start": 219.6,
   "end": 223.43,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 219.8,
     "end": 222.48
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 219.8,
     "end": 222.88
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp08-02",
   "section": "wp08",
   "zh": "他给门徒洗脚，教他们彼此服事。",
   "en": "He washed his disciples' feet and taught them to serve one another.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp08-02"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp08-02"
   ],
   "start": 223.43,
   "end": 230.26,
   "speech": {
    "zh": {
     "start": 223.63,
     "end": 226.71
    },
    "en": {
     "start": 223.63,
     "end": 229.71
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "wp08-03",
   "section": "wp08",
   "zh": "我们也可以把自己会的，用来帮助别人。把难懂的地方讲清楚，认真听一句还没说完的话，承认自己刚才说错了。",
   "en": "We can use what we know to help others too: explain something difficult, listen to a sentence that is not yet finished, and admit when we have said something wrong.",
   "zhIds": [
    "wp08-03",
    "wp08-04"
   ],
   "enIds": [
    "wp08-03"
   ],
   "start": 230.26,
   "end": 242.75,
